  "description": "State of charge for the largest N battery storage units in the NEM and WEM fleet that publish data, from OpenElectricity. SOC is derived, not published: stored energy divided by registered capacity. The NEM facilities list also returns WEM units, so one of the units in scope may be WEM and is queried against its own network. Hourly poll, free-plan request budget.",
